# Personal Claude Code state (`.claude/` itself is tracked: agents, hooks, skills).
# The hook debug log rotates to dated names (`hook-debug.log.YYYY-MM-DD`) that
# `*.log` does not match, and has reached 1.6 GB in a day.
.claude/hook-debug.log*
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/*.lock
